The most derived class's mem-initializer for an indirect virtual base is
the one used (N5008 [class.base.init]/7, /13); the intermediate bases'
initializers for it are ignored, and their base-object constructors and
destructors (hidden `@most_derived' parameter false, Itanium C++ ABI 5.1.4)
neither construct nor destroy it.
